  "MissingStructure": "complete structure",
  "ReasonDeclarationMoved": "This name is declared by this script, but the declaration is no longer in the current text:\nthose lines were most likely edited or deleted after the hint appeared and before the structure was opened.",
  "ReasonSynthesizedDefinition": "sys.synonyms/sys.sequences returned no rows, and the query itself did not fail.\nThere are only two possible reasons: the object was dropped after the suggestion list was cached,\nor this login's permission on it was revoked since then.",
  "ReasonModuleDefinition": "OBJECT_DEFINITION returns NULL for only two reasons: the object was created WITH ENCRYPTION,\nor the current login lacks VIEW DEFINITION permission on it.",
  "ReasonClrDefinition": "It is implemented in a CLR assembly; its body is compiled into the assembly, so it has no T-SQL definition.
This is unrelated to encryption or permissions.",
  "ReasonExtendedDefinition": "It is an extended stored procedure implemented natively by SQL Server, so it has no T-SQL definition,
and its parameters are not in the catalog views either. This is unrelated to encryption or permissions; see the documentation for usage.",
  "ReasonConstraintParent": "A constraint's definition lives on its parent table: DEFAULT expressions are on the columns, and CHECK\nconditions, key columns and foreign key references are in that table's indexes and constraints.\nThat table was not fully read this time: it may have been dropped after this list was cached, this login's\npermission on it may have been revoked, or the query for its indexes and constraints failed.",
  "ReasonConstraintNotFound": "The parent table was read, but it has no constraint with this name: most likely the constraint was\ndropped or renamed after this list was cached. If it still appears after a refresh, it may be a kind of\nconstraint this extension does not read yet.",
  "ReasonNoColumns": "sys.columns returned no rows, and the query itself did not fail. There are only two possible reasons:\nthe object was dropped after the suggestion list was cached, or this login's permission on it was revoked since then.",
  "ReasonIndexQueryFailed": "The fourth-tier query failed, so an empty index list is not an answer. Possible causes: a lost connection,\na timeout, or a catalog view column used by the query that this server version lacks. The server's message\nis written to the diagnostic log when \"Verbose logging\" is on.",
  "ReasonExpressions": "Columns or constraints were found, but their full expressions could not be retrieved; the login may lack\nVIEW DEFINITION permission, or the object changed while it was being read. The column summary is kept,\nand no incomplete CREATE/ALTER is generated.",
  "ReasonStructurePending": "Indexes and constraints are still loading; wait until loading finishes before copying the script.\nOnly the columns retrieved so far are shown; partial data is not rebuilt into executable SQL.",
  "AvailableColumns": "{kind} columns ({count}):",
  "AvailableParameters": "Parameters ({count}):",
  "ColumnsNotLoaded": "(columns not yet loaded)",
  "ScriptDeclaredDefault": "(declared by script)",
  "ReturnValue": "(return value)",
  "TriggerDisabled": "{name} (disabled)"
